    {
      "bbox": [
        333,
        1009,
        1293,
        1253
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. Responsibilities of the Director. The Director\nshall, consistent with law and in consultation and together with\nthe Department of Housing Preservation and Development (HPD), the\nHuman Resources Administration (HRA) and such other agencies as\nthe Mayor may direct, recommend policies, procedures and\nguidelines, with respect to social, health, employment, shelter\nand other services for the homeless and for Single Room Occupancy\n(SRO) tenants; and coordinate and facilitate housing for the\nhomeless and SRO tenants, including, but not limited to, assisting\nthe agencies primarily responsible for:",
